		array( 'Legal guarantee and orders that arrive in poor condition', '<p>We are responsible for the dry ice being what you ordered (format and kilos) and arriving in good condition. This is the legal guarantee of conformity (articles 114 onwards of the Spanish consolidated General Law for the Protection of Consumers and Users).</p><p>Dry ice loses some weight through sublimation in transit, and this is normal. As a guide, in our own tests with closed boxes kept in the shade, over 29 hours the small box loses about 1.8 kg, the large box (15 and 20 kg) about 4.1 kg and the 30 kg box about 5.7 kg; more in hot weather. If it loses more than is normal for the journey time, if the box arrives broken or if the format is not the one you ordered, we replace it or, if that is not possible, give you a price reduction or a refund. At no cost to you: the replacement and its delivery are on us.</p><p>Please tell us on the day of delivery, with photos if you can, at info@dryicepack.es, on +34 936 73 76 41 or by WhatsApp on +34 686 980 471: that way we can replace it sooner. Telling us later does not mean you lose your rights.</p>' ),
