		array( 'Customer service and complaints', '<p>You can send us any enquiry, complaint or claim through any of these channels:</p><ul><li>Email: info@dryicepack.es</li><li>Phone: +34 936 73 76 41, at the standard rate, Monday to Friday, 9:00 to 18:00</li><li>WhatsApp: +34 686 980 471</li><li>The form on the contact page</li><li>Post: INDUNOVA IMS S.L., Ronda Alfonso X El Sabio, 10, 2º 1ª, 08301 Mataró (Barcelona), Spain</li><li>In person, at the warehouse: Camí Ca La Madrona 19 D, 08304 Mataró</li></ul><p>We send you a receipt with your complaint number on the same working day or the next, and we reply in writing within 15 calendar days at most.</p><p>The official complaint and claim forms of the Government of Catalonia (Generalitat de Catalunya) are available in Catalan, Spanish and English: at the warehouse and, if you ask for them, by email in electronic format.</p><p>If you are not satisfied with our reply, you can contact the consumer information office of your local council or the Catalan Consumer Agency (Agència Catalana del Consum, consum.gencat.cat), and request consumer mediation or arbitration. We are not signed up to any consumer arbitration scheme: if you ask, we will tell you in writing, in each case, whether we will take part.</p>' ),
